{"seq":4,"slug":"zhou-enlai-premier-governance","title":"周恩来：总理治国","stage":"DONE","category":"zhou-enlai","categoryLabel":"周恩来","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":2.5,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/06_zhou-enlai/4_zhou-enlai-premier-governance","introMarkdown":"# 周恩来：总理治国\n\n从1949年10月新中国成立到1976年1月去世，周恩来连续担任政府首脑长达二十六年。先是中央人民政府政务院总理（1949年10月—1954年9月），后是国务院总理（1954年9月—1976年1月）。这一段任期跨越了国民经济恢复、第一个五年计划、社会主义改造、\"大跃进\"的曲折、国民经济调整以及\"文化大革命\"的动荡，几乎涵盖了共和国前二十七年的全部重大政务进程。\n\n本卷聚焦\"总理治国\"这一主题，即周恩来作为政府行政首脑如何组织、运转并维系国家机器，而非泛述其一生。与作为革命家、军事谈判者或党内领导人的周恩来不同，总理岗位上的他面对的是一套庞大的行政体系：几十个部委、数百万公职人员、覆盖工业农业财政外交国防科技文教各领域的日常治理。\n\n理解这位总理，需要把握几条主线。其一是制度构建：他主持组建了新中国第一届中央政府，确立了政务院（后为国务院）的运行框架与议事规则。其二是经济治理：他长期主管国民经济计划与平衡，强调经济建设\"居于首要地位\"，并在1964年与1975年两度向全国人大正式提出\"四个现代化\"的奋斗目标。其三是外交开拓：作为首任外交部长，他提出和平共处五项原则，在1955年万隆会议上以\"求同存异\"打开局面，并在1971—1972年间推动中美关系破冰。\n\n本卷另一条不可回避的线索是周恩来在极端政治环境中的处境。\"文化大革命\"期间，他在维护国家正常运转、保护一批党政军干部与知识分子、维系工农业生产不致全面崩溃方面付出了巨大努力，同时也承受着复杂而沉重的政治压力。对这一时期的评价，史学界历来存在不同视角，本卷力求依据可查证的史实，呈现其作为而不作过度褒贬。\n\n全卷按\"组建政府—经济建设—外交与风范\"三章展开，共八篇专题文档。每篇力求标注具体日期、地点、文件与人物，引用《政府工作报告》、上海公报、和平共处五项原则等原始文献，以百科式的中立笔调，为一般历史读者提供一份可靠、可核查的参考读物。\n\n阅读本卷，读者不仅能看到一位以\"鞠躬尽瘁\"著称的行政领袖如何处理国务，也能从一个侧面观察新中国行政体制的起源、运转逻辑及其在特殊年代承受的张力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"establishing-the-state-apparatus","title":"组建与运转新中国政府","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/establishing-the-state-apparatus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forming-the-government-administration-council","title":"政务院的组建：新中国第一届中央政府","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/establishing-the-state-apparatus/forming-the-government-administration-council"},{"seq":2,"slug":"restoring-the-economy-first-five-year-plan","title":"国民经济恢复与第一个五年计划","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/establishing-the-state-apparatus/restoring-the-economy-first-five-year-plan"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-construction-and-modernization","title":"经济建设与现代化探索","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/economic-construction-and-modernization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"managing-the-national-economy","title":"国民经济的日常治理：平衡、反冒进与调整","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/economic-construction-and-modernization/managing-the-national-economy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"four-modernizations-and-1975-report","title":"\"四个现代化\"与1975年《政府工作报告》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/economic-construction-and-modernization/four-modernizations-and-1975-report"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stabilizing-economy-during-cultural-revolution","title":"\"文化大革命\"中维系国家运转","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/economic-construction-and-modernization/stabilizing-economy-during-cultural-revolution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"diplomacy-and-statecraft","title":"外交开拓与治国风范","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/diplomacy-and-statecraft","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"five-principles-and-bandung","title":"和平共处五项原则与万隆会议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/diplomacy-and-statecraft/five-principles-and-bandung"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sino-american-rapprochement","title":"中美破冰：从乒乓外交到《上海公报》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/diplomacy-and-statecraft/sino-american-rapprochement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"work-style-and-final-years","title":"工作作风、人格特质与晚年岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/zhou-enlai/zhou-enlai-premier-governance/diplomacy-and-statecraft/work-style-and-final-years"}]}]}